<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Storage USA FFO raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Storage USA FFO raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- EVEREN Securities Inc said Friday it raised its funds from operations estimates on Storage USA Inc to $2.92 from $2.90 for 1997 and to $3.24 from $3.20 for 1998.</p>
<p>-- Its six-month price target on the stock is $40.</p>
<p>-- Storage USA, a real estate investment trust, was off 1/8 at 38-3/8.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
